<title>CANADA: MDC to sell C$50 mln 7 pct debentures.</title>
<headline>MDC to sell C$50 mln 7 pct debentures.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MDC Communications Corp said on Tuesday it entered into a bought deal agreement to sell C$50 million of seven percent unsecured subordinated convertible debentures maturing January 7, 2007 to a syndicate of underwriters.</p>
<p>MDC said the underwriters have the option to purchase an additional C$10 million of convertible debentures.</p>
<p>The debenture interest will be payable semi-annually on June 30 and December 31, MDC said.</p>
<p>It said proceeds of the offering will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
